rules (97):
  R-W2-BOX1-SUM : Sum box 1 of each distinct Form W-2 (images of the same W-2 are matched and counted once).
  R-W2-BOX2-SUM : Sum box 2 of each distinct Form W-2.
  R-W2-BOX17-SUM : Sum box 17 (California) of each distinct Form W-2.
  R-SUM : Arithmetic combination of the listed input lines.
  R-CARRY : Value carried from the listed line.
  R-INTEREST-PAYER : One line per interest payer from Forms 1099-INT, composite statements, K-1s and foreign statements. 
  R-DIVIDEND-PAYER : One line per dividend payer.
  R-FOREIGN-ACCOUNT : Answered from the presence of a foreign account statement.

